---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" description="Our goal is to bring together the best offers available to students and help you make the most of the benefits you're entitled to.">
  <div class="container">
    <article class="prose about-copy" aria-label="About Studentoffers.am">
      <h1>Our goal is to bring together the best offers available to students and help you make the most of the benefits you're entitled to.</h1>
      <p>I've personally discovered and used many of the deals featured on this website, saving a significant amount of money along the way.</p>
      <p>But finding these offers was often unnecessarily difficult. Student discounts are scattered across different websites, and there's no single place where you can easily discover them all.</p>
      <p>That's why I created Studentoffers.am — to make student discounts easier to find, understand, and use.</p>
      <p><strong>Being a student comes with benefits. Why not make the most of them and save money?</strong></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
